# Azure Marketplace Billing & Token Metering Architecture

All MAF agent node executions MUST pass through sequential billing and token verification gates before invoking any Azure OpenAI model.

## 1. Plan Definitions & Thresholds
*   **Free / Trial Plan (`free_trial`):** $20.00 USD token allowance, 14-day limit. Hard halt (`swarm_status = "trial_expired"`) when exceeded.
*   **Paid Plan (`paid_monthly`):** $999.00/month. $350.00 USD monthly token allowance.
*   **Overage Rate:** $3.00 billed per $1.00 raw token spend exceeding $350.00 (3x multiplier).

## 2. Metering & Protection
*   Atomic cost accumulation in PostgreSQL using `SELECT FOR UPDATE`.
*   Emit overage to Azure Marketplace Metering API.
*   Support `process.env.SWARM_ALL_AGENTS_ENABLED` override for internal test environments.